         SDK corrections vs the original sketch (verified against MacOSX.sdk
         MTL4*.h, macOS 26):
           - MTL4 encoder end reuses the existing MTLCommandEncoder_endEncoding
             (code 33): MTL4CommandEncoder declares -endEncoding and ObjC
             dispatches by selector, so no distinct MTL4 end entry was added.
           - Device factory is -newCommandAllocator / -newCommandBuffer /
             -newCompilerWithDescriptor: (not the sketch's bare names).
           - Pipeline blend enable is the MTL4BlendState enum (not a BOOL) and
             alpha-to-coverage is MTL4AlphaToCoverageState; functions are set
             via MTL4LibraryFunctionDescriptor.vertexFunctionDescriptor /
             fragmentFunctionDescriptor, and the compiler entry is
             -newRenderPipelineStateWithDescriptor:compilerTaskOptions:error:.
           - Queue commit is -commit:count: (no options variant needed).
         Smoke: tests/bridge_smoke.cpp gains an MTL4 section — queue/allocator/
